content = '''\"\"\"Minimal standard-library client for OpenAI's Responses API.

Send private text prompts to "'``https://api.openai.com/v1/responses``
without any third-party dependencies. Only ``urllib``, ``json`` and other
modules from the Python standard library are used.

Typical usage::

    from openai_client import send_prompt

    reply = send_prompt("Explain quantum entanglement in one paragraph.")
    print(reply.text)

